				<spell>
						<name>Touch of Blindness</name>
						<outputname>Touch of Blindness</outputname>
						<times_memorized>1</times_memorized>
						<range>Touch</range>
						<components>V</components>
						<castingtime>1 standard action</castingtime>
						<casterlevel>3</casterlevel>
						<concentration>+8</concentration>
						<dc>16</dc>
						<duration>3 rounds [see text]</duration>
						<effect>A touch from your hand, which is engulfed in darkness, disrupts a creature&#39;s vision by coating its eyes in supernatural darkness. Each touch causes the target to become blinded for 1 round unless it makes a successful Fortitude saving throw. You can use this melee touch attack up to 3 times. Any touch attack not used after 3 rounds is lost.</effect>
						<target>Creature or creatures touched</target>
						<saveinfo>Fortitude negates</saveinfo>
						<school>
							<school>Necromancy</school>
							<subschool></subschool>
							<descriptor>Darkness, Shadow</descriptor>
							<fullschool>Necromancy [Darkness, Shadow]</fullschool>
						</school>
