							<sourcelink></sourcelink>
							<sourcepage>p.29</sourcepage>
							<sourceshort>BOS</sourceshort>
						</source>
						<spell_resistance>Yes</spell_resistance>
						<description>A touch from your hand, which is engulfed in darkness, disrupts a creature&#39;s vision by coating its eyes in supernatural darkness. Each touch causes the target to become blinded for 1 round unless it makes a successful Fortitude saving throw. You can use this melee touch attack up to 3 times. Any touch attack not used after 3 rounds is lost.</description>
						<bonusspell></bonusspell>
				</spell>
